  "body": "Your own place by the beach, with everything you need close by. Lot 15 is an inviting entry into COAST Orewa: a brand new, single-level, one-bedroom home just 350m from the beach.\r\n\r\nA lovely north-facing aspect and generous patio create a welcoming setting for morning coffee, lunch outdoors or a relaxed evening after a beach walk. Compact and easy to manage, this home gives you more time to enjoy the coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for an everyday home, a lock-and-leave retreat or your own beachside bolthole, Lot 15 deserves a closer look. \r\n\r\nStage 1 has just been released, and only two homes of this type remain.\r\n\r\nA New Place to Call Home in Orewa\r\nCOAST is a new residential development bringing together a mix of townhouses and apartments, with one, two and three bedroom options across single level and two level layouts. From compact coastal retreats to more spacious homes, the development offers a choice of ways to make Orewa your home.\r\n\r\nFour retail premises also form part of the project, adding a commercial element alongside the residential homes.\r\nPositioned only 200m to Orewa's town centre, COAST puts shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday essentials within easy reach. Pick up your groceries, meet friends for coffee or wander down to the beach - it's a location where you can leave the car at home and enjoy your neighbourhood on foot.\r\n\r\nFor buyers seeking the ease of a new home alongside the character of an established coastal town, COAST brings both together.\r\n\r\nConstruction Is Underway\r\nYour home is currently under construction with an experienced New Zealand build partner and comes with a 10 year building warranty. Completion is expected in March 2027, with settlement shortly after.\r\n\r\nExplore Stage 1 Today\r\nLot 15 offers an opportunity to secure one of COAST's entry level homes in this newly released stage. With only two homes of this type remaining, register your interest now to receive the details and discuss your next steps.\r\n\r\nOnsite access is currently restricted while construction progresses. Viewing appointments will be available in the first week of November. Contact Dylan or Zoe today to book.\r\n\r\nVisit coastorewa.com to register your interest and sign up for updates on future releases, including other home types as they become available.\r\n\r\nCome home to convenience. Come home to the COAST.",
